    "title": "Shohei Ohtani to play for Team Japan in 2026 World Baseball Classic - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jacob Macofsky ,\n16 hours ago The World Baseball Classic will return in 2026, and with it features some of baseball’s brightest stars from around the globe representing their home country. Shohei Ohtani, then with the Angels, struck out his former Angels teammate Mike Trout to win the WBC for Team Japan. It won’t be the final moment for him in the WBC, as Ohtani will look to defend his nation’s title for the 2026 classic, taking to his Instagram to announce his decision to return. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
